# Implementation Plan - Skill Streak + XP System

This plan outlines the implementation of a gamification system for Scholarium, including XP tracking, daily streaks, and a weekly leaderboard to drive user engagement.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The leaderboard will be calculated based on XP earned within the last 7 days. We will implement a new `XPActivity` model to track these individual gains accurately.

